    "1. Extract `chromadb_si_utm.zip` ke `RAG_SI_UTM/chromadb_si_utm/`\n",
    "2. Install Ollama dari https://ollama.com\n",
    "3. `ollama pull qwen2.5:7b`\n",
    "4. `streamlit run app_streamlit.py`\n",
    "\n",
